(m)", "type": "int"}, {"name": "stadedeveloppement", "description": null, "annotations": {"facet": true, "facetsort": "alphanum", "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true}, "label": "STADE DE DEVELOPPEMENT", "type": "text"}, {"name": "remarquable", "description": null, "annotations": {"facet": true, "facetsort": "alphanum", "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true}, "label": "REMARQUABLE", "type": "text"}, {"name": "geo_point_2d", "description": null, "annotations": {}, "label": "geo_point_2d", "type": "geo_point_2d"}], "dataset_id": "les-arbres", "dataset_uid": "da_4k8l4p", "has_records": true, "features": ["analyze", "geo"], "attachments": [], "alternative_exports": [], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"dcat": {"created": null, "issued": null, "creator": "Mairie de Paris / Direction des Espaces Verts et de l'Environnement", "contributor": "Mairie de Paris / Direction des Espaces Verts et de l'Environnement", "contact_name": null, "contact_email": null, "accrualperiodicity": "Hebdomadaire", "spatial": null, "temporal": null, "granularity": null, "dataquality": null, "publisher_type": null, "conforms_to": null, "temporal_coverage_start": null, "temporal_coverage_end": null, "accessRights": null, "relation": null}, "default": {"title": "Arbres", "description": "<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14.7px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica;\"><b>Cette couche g\u00e9o-localise une partie des arbres relevant de la Ville de Paris.</b></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 14.7px; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica; min-height: 17px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.7px;\">Cela inclut les arbres d\u2019alignement (dans les rues), ceux des espaces verts et des \u00e9quipements publics municipaux. Elle n\u2019inclut pas les bosquets, les ensembles forestiers, les arbres du domaine priv\u00e9 etc.</span></font></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font face=\"Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.7px;\">Attention : cette donn\u00e9e n\u2019est pas mise \u00e0 jour en temps r\u00e9el et de grands d\u00e9calages peuvent appara\u00eetre (particuli\u00e8rement dans les espaces verts) et son p\u00e9rim\u00e8tre ne couvre ni l\u2019ensemble de l\u2019action de la Ville, ni les arbres priv\u00e9s.\u00a0</span></font></p><div><br></div><p class=\"p3\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica;\">Sur cette couche de donn\u00e9es sont renseign\u00e9s la mensuration, la classification des arbres (partielle et pour les arbres remarquables).</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Helvetica;\">Pour plus de renseignements, consultez la rubrique\u00a0<a href=\"https://www.paris.fr/pages/l-arbre-a-paris-199\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"color: rgb(41, 101, 168);\"><i>Arbres</i></span></a><i>\u00a0</i>h\u00e9berg\u00e9e sur le site Paris.fr .</p>", "theme": ["Environnement"], "keyword": ["Arbres", "Espacesverts", "DEVE"], "license": "Open Database License (ODbL)", "license_url": "http://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/", "language": "fr", "metadata_languages": ["fr"], "timezone": null, "modified": "2026-10-09T08:35:00+00:00", "modified_updates_on_metadata_change": fa